      P("Today more than a billion people lack clean drinking water, and quarrels break out over a single bucket. When we let clean water run into the drain, we waste what others are praying for. Saving water is part of our religion, and it brings good in this world and Allah’s pleasure in the next. || Bugun dunyoda bir milliarddan ortiq kishi toza ichimlik suviga muhtoj, bir chelak suv uchun janjal chiqmoqda. Biz toza suvni ariqqa oqizib yuborsak, boshqalar duo qilib so‘rayotgan narsani isrof qilgan bo‘lamiz. Suvni tejash dinimizning bir qismi, u bu dunyoda yaxshilik, oxiratda Allohning roziligini keltiradi."),
