      { q: "How much water did the Prophet ﷺ use for wuḍūʾ? || Payg‘ambar ﷺ tahoratga qancha suv ishlatardilar?", options: ["A whole bucket || Bir chelak", "One mudd || Bir mudd", "A river || Bir daryo", "A barrel || Bir bochka"], answer: 1, why: "About two handfuls, roughly two-thirds of a litre. || Taxminan ikki hovuch, uchdan ikki litrga yaqin.", src: "Bukhari 201" },
