      { q: "What did the old jurists write chapters about? || Qadimgi fuqaholar qanday boblar ochganlar?", options: ["Not wasting water even from the sea || Dengizdan olganda ham suvni isrof qilmaslik", "Building fountains || Favvora qurish", "Selling water || Suv sotish", "Swimming || Suzish"], answer: 0, why: "That is how much they valued water. || Ular suvni shunchalik qadrlaganlar.", src: B("Suvning isrofi haqida") },
