      { q: "What is the thrifty way to wash a car? || Mashinani yuvishning tejamkor yo‘li qaysi?", options: ["A running hose for an hour || Bir soat oqib turgan shlang", "A bucket || Chelak", "Drinking water from the tap left open || Ochiq jo‘mrakdagi ichimlik suvi", "Not cleaning it ever || Hech yuvmaslik"], answer: 1, why: "The book suggests a bucket. || Kitob chelakni tavsiya qiladi.", src: B("Suvning isrofi haqida") },
